  "term": "opinion",
  "definition": "Opinion is a private, individual belief, understood as belonging to the person who holds it rather than as knowledge. In historical usage, it was often contrasted with knowledge and could imply uncertainty or a lack of objective support, as in the idea of a \"mere opinion.\"",
